        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, mounted, Desktop PC mainboard, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, mounted, Desktop PC mainboard, at plant
Data are based on own assumption - assuming that after 2023 udpates, 100% of all desktop PC mainboards are produced, using Pb-free solder materials.; UUID: 2bf1c51f-3ca7-34d9-8ffe-58d76af7ddc6
This dataset represents a mix of Pb-containing and Pb-free soldered Desktop PC mainboards. It includes processes of components mounting using lead and lead free solder technology.
Location: Own estimation - used for the global average
Technology: Dataset represents the mix of lead and lead-free mounting of motherboards.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: own estimation
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2bf1c51f-3ca7-34d9-8ffe-58d76af7ddc6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
